      "writtenOn": "2026-10-29T18:28:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this include isn\u0027t found when building from `mm/`: `kselftest_p3s.h` sits in `tools/testing/selftests/`, and unlike `devzero_slice_p3s` and the other P3S targets, `mremap_slice_cow_p3s` gets no `CFLAGS +\u003d -I..`, so the mm build stops with \"kselftest_p3s.h: No such file or directory\". aosp/4367986 moves the test to `TEST_GEN_PROGS` but doesn\u0027t add the flag either.\n\nCould this include `\"../kselftest_p3s.h\"`, as `bpf_map_mmap_p3s.c` and `p3s_test.h` do? Or, if you prefer the per-target lines, with the `LOCAL_HDRS` one so that clang builds keep working:\n\n```\n$(OUTPUT)/mremap_slice_cow_p3s: CFLAGS +\u003d -I..\n$(OUTPUT)/mremap_slice_cow_p3s: LOCAL_HDRS +\u003d ../kselftest_p3s.h\n$(OUTPUT)/mremap_slice_cow_p3s: ../kselftest_p3s.h\n```",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "a056840050cbc6c10c5776160f9e585d7fa02894",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
